        "language": "rongmei",
        "title": "He kanloumeipu poubaumei",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. He kanloumeipu poubaumei nangjei tei,",
            "Kandihmei guai !-2 thuknga ning diu;",
            "Nang!-2 damloumei guaita jaujian khou!-2,",
            "Kandihmei guai lun phunga puan e.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Poubaumei Jisu guloumei,",
            "Nang na rap de meiring khang tei;",
            "Nang jan himdai diu,",
            "Guang hei jumei ru khouDailiangmei nang e.",
            "",
            "2. Kandihmei guai hei tingkauhmei sudiu khang,",
            "Nang !-2 kandihmei lun kei phunga;",
            "Tingkauh thu takmaknga nban thai diukhang,",
            "Nang!-2 rianra khanga kei puan e.",
            "",
            "3. Meinun guai !-2na tingsanga gai diu khang,",
            "Rianra rianriu kapum tei khang e;",
            "Kaniu nadap tari dat mak khang tei !-2,",
            "Khanglou khang tat the pirou bam khou.",
            "",
            "4. Kaniu tingsanga thei dat mak khang tei !-2,",
            "Ringtak makpui tuang tei ladiu khang;",
            "Nang !-2na kaniu tak maknga ring khang tei,",
            "Kalvari ching rukhou kei khang e."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
